<title>ITALY: Cirio H1 1996 pretax profit 10 bln lire.</title>
<headline>Cirio H1 1996 pretax profit 10 bln lire.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ending June 30</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>Group consolidated results</p>
<p>    Turnover				 739.2  vs up  4.2 pct</p>
<p>    Gross operating margin		62    vs up 11 pct</p>
<p>    Pretax				    10    vs 533 million</p>
<p>    Net debt				 419.9  vs 423.8 (end-1995)</p>
<p>NOTE - Cirio is an Italian food manufacturing company.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
